        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 6665/6405, Stanford Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThere is something to be said for traditional beauty; and the oval mounts of this Weslock made Stanford Dummy Handleset paired with the delicate curved handle will not disappoint those looking for a classic that can withstand the ever changing fashions of today's world with undeniable elegance. Available in satin nickel and oil rubbed bronze finishes. A dummy handleset, the Weslock made Traditional Oval Stanford Dummy Handleset is just for looks; it neither latches nor locks. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull or on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function--neither locking nor latching.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-oval-stanford-single-cylinder-handleset-weslock-6661-6400\"><b>Stanford Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/traditional-stanford-double-cylinder-handleset-weslock-6661-6402\"><b>Stanford Double Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditionally styled handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-elegance-collection\"><b>Weslock Elegance Collection</b></a> which features lifetime finish and mechanical warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Traditional Oval Stanford Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Elegance Collection Traditional Stanford Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
